 Elections Commission 
 The Elections Commission manages and conducts all elections in Brockton and maintains all election records. The Commission is also responsible for voter registration. 
 As a non-partisan resource, the Elections Commission is a great place to start for anyone interested in running for public office. The Elections Commission also conducts the city’s annual census. Each year, a census form is mailed out to all Brockton residents. The information from that survey helps to determine the city’s eligibility for many important programs and grants. 







